.page-section.p-120-cont.cg-section.clearfix(id="services-link")
    .container
        .row
            .col-md-10.col-md-offset-1.text-center.mb-60
                h2.cg-section-title Services
                p.cg-section-lead Productized backend engagements—clear scope, senior execution, no generic dev shop retainers.
        .row
            .col-md-4
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='200ms')
                    h3 AWS cost optimization audit
                    ul
                        li Baseline spend and find waste in compute, Lambda, API Gateway, networking, and storage
                        li Deliver a prioritized savings plan your team can implement—or we execute with you
                        li Guardrails so cost gains hold as traffic grows
                    a.cg-offer-link(href="#quote-request") Get an AWS cost analysis →
            .col-md-4
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='400ms')
                    h3 Backend performance engineering
                    ul
                        li Trace production bottlenecks in APIs and workers
                        li Tune Go services and distributed workflows under real load
                        li Improve latency and reliability—not just load-test dashboards
                    a.cg-offer-link(href="#quote-request") Book a performance audit →
            .col-md-4
                .cg-offer-card.wow.fadeIn(data-wow-delay='600ms')
                    h3 Serverless migration
                    ul
                        li Design event-driven boundaries for the right workloads
                        li Move suitable surfaces to AWS Lambda with clear cutover plans
                        li Reduce operational overhead without losing observability
                    a.cg-offer-link(href="#quote-request") Request a systems review →
